2. VOICING THRESHOLD CORRUPTION DUE TO UNREMOVED DC
===========================================================================
Noise Frame (sigma = 1000.0, N = 638 samples):
  WITHOUT DC: Peak normalized r(tau)/r(0) in scan range [26, 214] = 0.1977
              Praat VOICING_THRESHOLD = 0.4500
              Status: UNVOICED (Correct)
  WITH DC c = 1000.0:
              Peak normalized r(tau)/r(0) in scan range [26, 214] = 0.6023
              Status: VOICED (FATAL ERROR - False Alarm)
>>> Conclusion: Without local mean subtraction, DC offset elevates noise autocorrelation
    above 0.45, turning whisper and background noise into false voiced pitch frames!
